            "review_title": "Review at La Haye - Sala",
            "review_text": "T L\nVancouver, Canada23 contributions\n0\nDon’t get mix up by the brand and location - average HCMC family restaurant\nJan 2025 • Friends\nOrdered a bottle of Rosso and it is definitely corked. So ordered another bottle of Italian, which was ok.\n\nUpon check out, they insisted to charge me the corked wine… but gave me 10% discount. I paid that - with tax. No point to argue with the people who don’t know wine at all.\n\nFood was ok - service was average. \n\nBeware of kids running around like playground. Definitely not best spot for business dinner.\n\nVery likely I will not go back and for that price tag - I am not recommending any of friend to go.\nRead more\nWritten January 4, 2025",
